summary.label:
Our epuBear Reader acts as a standalone reader for EPUB format books with no ads and no limitations and the solution is based on epuBear SDK developed by Scand.

Core Functionality:
- Reading EPUB format files;
- Performance indicators display;

epuBear Reader Features:
- Compatibility with EPUB 2 and EPUB3 format;
- Navigation through pages;
- Navigation through chapters;
- Night mode;
- Font size change;
- Embedded links support;
- Text search;
- Text and background color change;
- Bookmarks;
- Text-to-speach;
- Text notes and highlights;
- Ad-free;
- Fast and smooth;
- Clear and simple interface;
- Customer support.
